        "tip": "Hooks represent a fundamental paradigm shift in React from Object-Oriented patterns to Functional/Composition patterns.",
        "mistake": "Trying to use a Hook inside an older Class component. Hooks ONLY work inside Functional components (or inside custom hooks).",
