        "explanation": "Zustand (German for 'State') is a small, fast, and highly popular global state management library for React. \nIt provides a minimalist alternative to Redux. It uses a single centralized store and custom hooks, but completely eliminates the massive boilerplate of Redux (no providers, no reducers, no dispatching action types).",
