        "mistake": "Trying to achieve 100% code coverage by writing unit tests for static, dumb components (like a `<p>` tag wrapper). Test behaviors, not implementation details.",
        "summary": "Using a combination of Unit tests (Jest/Vitest) for logic, Integration tests (React Testing Library) for component behavior, and E2E tests (Cypress/Playwright) for critical user flows."
